{"id":"3996096799974826489","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"被尹淨漢帶入坑的我有資格去看演唱會吧\n身為漢擔的我有資格去看演唱會吧\n還是說一定要嗑ㄓˉㄏㄢˋ才能去\n那我去不了了怎麼辦\n不要再認為全世界的人都得跟你嗑同一對好嗎\n我支持他們是因為我愛尹淨漢 我愛洪知秀\n再給我硬是戴上CP的帽子試試看","username":"c__zz.y","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@c__zz.y/post/Dd0_N4KkyH5","timestamp":"2026-09-28T10:38:02Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:11.556171583Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_9cd1a1b2fb3e6b64","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"3996166208340764122","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"今天的追星花路太扯 ✨\n先和朋朋約在 Haru 見面，竟然巧遇上次一起看李東海演唱會的韓飯妹妹，再次相遇真的超神奇！路上還看到海來公司並對我們揮手（只有我看到，算我的 XD）。\n接著去吃童的烤肉店，吃到一半朋朋的本命李赫宰竟然走進來，朋朋直接感動大哭 🥹\n壽星童本人大概隔了20分鐘進來，隔壁童飯送了藍色葛瑪蘭當生日禮物，童童秒開來喝還直接帶走，成就了這支影片！","username":"lane30_70","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@lane30_70/post/Dd1O_5vkiXa","timestamp":"2026-09-28T12:55:56Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:11.556304484Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_073d20d47d0e3329","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"3996174241128999024","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"希望所有喜歡Kpop的人都可以參加一次 B1A4的演唱會\n真的真的真的太好玩、太值回票價了\n很喜歡Legacy TERA肉眼可及的視野\n讓我沒有錄影，也可以用雙眼把三人都記在腦海裡\n-燦多的笑容和臉蛋都超可愛\n-孔燦的帥顏是無法形容的精緻\n-信宇的靦腆讓人很想逗弄他\n-三人現場唱歌比音源還好聽，高音和合音讓人很震撼\n還有又唱又跳很穩，跳舞超整齊超好看\n先這樣。","username":"chocolike67","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@chocolike67/post/Dd1Q0y3D2hw","timestamp":"2026-09-28T13:11:53Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:11.555998652Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_1bc1cdef89cc2490","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":false,"clean_exclusion_reason":"ticket_resale"}
{"id":"3996204527828701753","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"今天真的太幸福了😭😭\n我覺得我玩的比首爾場還瘋哈哈哈\n我完全失去我的聲音了很好笑\n原本還覺得只有兩小時很可惜\n結果最後還是唱了2.5小時嗚嗚嗚\n台灣場真的100000分哈哈哈\n有唱choom跟I.B.L我真的大哭\n還搶先聽到dark tale😍\n我沒想到他還會宣傳solo演唱會\n但我已經買好票了哈哈哈🥹🫶🏻\n真的是排除萬難去看了🫪\n孔燦植是神隊友很認真看影片\n還知道要cue他哥唱歌不然可能就被混過去了🫪\n（應援團隊真的很神這個影片超可愛！！！手幅也超級讚的😭😭）\n今日潑水mvp 孔燦植🏆🏆🏆\n我真的冷死了鞋子還濕掉🤧\n最後擊掌竟然是雙手擊掌😭\n我還跟李燦多說solo演唱會見了哈哈","username":"yihsuan_02","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@yihsuan_02/post/Dd1XthjCZI5","timestamp":"2026-09-28T14:12:04Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:11.556225956Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_12a3c1b6549debb6","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"3996207605366411839","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"2026/9/28 at Kaohsiung \n\n@henrymoodie \nMood swings tour 演唱會歌單🎵\n\n1. Mood swings \n2. Sunday morning \n3. People pleaser \n4. Closure\n5. Bad emotions \n6. Cigarettes \n7. Right person wrong time\n8. Me, myself and I\n9. MISS U\n10. The one you got away(cover)\n11. Dear drew\n12. Favorite mistake \n13. Beat up car\n14. Indigo\n15. Drunck text \n16. Pick up the phone\n17. Ten years time\n\n雖然中間等了30分鐘，大家都在尋找Henry 哈哈哈\n一切都還是值得🥹","username":"rochellechang","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@rochellechang/post/Dd1YaTulFI_","timestamp":"2026-09-28T14:18:11Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:11.556147978Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_89f0821384cb30f2","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"3996208991298545762","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"超級可惜\n本想說第一次看 Henry Moodie 演唱會\n心心念念一個月左右要到高雄看演唱會\n不過考量到回家的車次\n決定忍痛早退離開現場\n\n雖然有聽到我自己的愛歌 mood swings\n還玩到亨利老哥指派的歌聲對決遊戲😝\n不過我最期待他唱 pick up the phone\n還有他的第一首 you were there for me\n\n就在我走出門口 亨利哥就唱了那兩首🥹","username":"jules_reece_lee","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@jules_reece_lee/post/Dd1Yueekmhi","timestamp":"2026-09-28T14:20:56Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:11.556249942Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_f1ba45ba791c631c","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"3996212039702616399","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"第一次看韓團演唱會就獻給B1A4 \nLegacy Tera的冷氣夠涼\n本來想說怕熱的我放髮會不會熱\n冷氣加潑水完全不會熱\n燦多今天的透視裝好性感\n露手臂次數也不少\n感謝信宇幫忙脫（？\n音響超好高音party聽得很過癮\n\n課題曲길我一個晚上抱佛腳\n還是沒辦法唱rap\n好像只有副歌還行\n主歌靠後面的韓國粉絲帶\n我一路跟著唱\n今天不管是應援還是唱歌\n都是偷跟著後面韓國粉絲喊\n不過A day of love我有練熟\n把歌詞貼在辦公桌真的有用\n努力循環一個禮拜總算有成果\n\n沒想到演唱會有水炸彈（？\n一開始哥哥們還有點擔心\n說會預告如果不想被潑可以擋\n燦多摸了水瓶還說水有點冰\n有沒有溫水\n結果後來潑得挺開心的\n孔燦左右開弓右邊變重災區\n手幅放在地板拿起來已經濕了\n\n燦多一度在台上打哈欠\n被信宇問想睡覺嗎 要不要回飯店\n超級好笑\n整場我都在尖叫跟大笑\n\n感謝願意跟我換福利的Bana\n我們今天都是一個人來 很勇敢\n希望下次你的朋友可以跟你一起來\n我有這次經驗下次應該比較不會怕\n\nHi Touch我原本以為只能單手\n雙手實在太幸福了\n我太害羞擊掌不敢直視成員們\n好像沒有好好抬頭看清楚臉","username":"sakuerza","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@sakuerza/post/Dd1Za1hnRlP","timestamp":"2026-09-28T14:26:59Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:11.556131393Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-28T20:33:17.628728Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_0027dfa6449395fc","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
